<p>Draw on the wounds of enemies within range 10, healing yourself and putting them into a merciful sleep.</p><p>The sleep chance increases with your Spellpower.</p><p>You are healed for 20% of the remaining damage of bleed effects on enemies in range (minimum <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 15, 18, 22, 25</acronym> per bleed). Enemies fall asleep for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 1, 2, 3, 3</acronym> turns longer than their longest-lasting bleed, rendering them unable to act. The strength of the sleep effect is based on the strength of the bleed. Excess damage will reduce their sleep duration.</p><p></p><p>When the sleep ends, each target will benefit from Insomnia for a number of turns equal to the amount of time it was asleep (up to ten turns max), granting it 50% sleep immunity.</p>